Description: The demo deployment of blockr.process: a quarterly data
    collection that repeats per reporting unit, its element lists, and a
    stand-in for the delivery platform -- a button that writes an inbox
    message, exactly as the platform would. Everything here is deployment
    code, the kind of thing every installation writes for itself; the
    package under test is blockr.process. Demo only; lives in
    blockr.process/dev/.
